#: selfdrive\ui\layouts\settings\developer.py
msgid "<b>WARNING: sunnypilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, sunnypilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of sunnypilot's longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to sunnypilot longitudinal control. Enabling Experimental mode is recommended when enabling sunnypilot longitudinal control alpha. Changing this setting will restart sunnypilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "<b>警告：此車的 sunnypilot 縱向控制處於 Alpha 階段，可能會停用自動緊急制動（AEB）。</b><br><br>在此車上，sunnypilot 預設使用車輛自帶的 ACC，而不使用 sunnypilot 的縱向控制。啟用本項將切換為 sunnypilot 縱向控制。啟用 sunnypilot 縱向控制 Alpha 時建議同時啟用實驗模式。車輛上電時更改此設定會重啟 sunnypilot。"

